body:
Hey!

I'm trying to format the pips in my rangeSlider but cant get it to work.
I've looked a little bit at this https://github.com/algolia/instantsearch.js/issues/1436
But I am just getting "Function wNumb not definied", and i dont know what should be inside this function.

I've managed to format the tooltips like this:

```
tooltips: {
      format: function(rawValue) {
            return '$' . rawValue;
      }
},
```

However, If i am doing similar to the Pips, its not working. Any ideas on how i can do this?
